              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can I certify PT Level 2 directly without Level 1?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes. SNT-TC-1A allows direct Level II certification against the cumulative requirements — 12 classroom hours, 210 PT hours, 400 total NDT hours — plus the Level II exams. It is the normal route for experienced techs changing employers, since certification does not transfer but documented hours do."
              }
