          "@type": "TechArticle",
          "headline": "How 29 CFR 1910.119(j) reaches NDT inspector qualification and records",
          "description": "29 CFR 1910.119(j) has six subparagraphs and names no NDT scheme. Where inspector qualification, procedures, records and deficiency correction actually sit.",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "@id": "https://atlantisndt.com/#anoop-rayavarapu",
            "name": "Anoop Rayavarapu"
          },
