              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can our SNT-TC-1A written practice cover tank car work?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Not on its own. MSRP Section C-III Appendix T sets the personnel training hours, NDT procedure requirements and inspection reporting requirements for tank car work, and the manual's definition of an NDT Level III rejects self-certification or company appointment outright, requiring the Appendix T paragraph 1.8.4 testing requirements. A written practice built on SNT-TC-1A alone will not satisfy an auditor working from Appendix T. The practical answer is a written practice that meets Appendix T explicitly and maps to SNT-TC-1A where the facility also serves other sectors."
              }
