              "name": "How long does initial M-1003 certification take?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "The AAR states that approval timeframes range from four to nine months depending on the product type, the technical approvals needed and the facility's location. That window covers application review, QA code and audit agency assignment, lead auditor review of the quality manual and QAPE checklist, and scheduling. Paragraph 3.3.4.1 adds a real risk to the schedule: an audit will not be scheduled until deficiencies or discrepancies in the manual or the QAPE have been resolved, so a weak manual extends the clock before anyone visits."
              }
