                "text": "Scope the methods and customers, then build the written practice from the customer flowdowns. Write and approve method procedures and technique sheets. Reconstruct or complete technician experience logs, then administer general, specific and practical examinations in the order NAS 410 Revision 5 requires. Complete the self-audit against the official checklists at least thirty days before the visit and close the findings you generate yourself. Then host the audit with the Level III present."
