                "text": "Yes. Every SNT-TC-1A written practice requires a Level III to author or approve it, approve procedures, and administer certification examinations, regardless of whether nuclear scope is involved. TVA specification work at Chickamauga, Raccoon Mountain or a combined-cycle station relies on that written practice being valid. Without a signing Level III, every certification issued is exposed the moment a contract audit opens the file."
