                "text": "Z17 Annex 1 section 1.2 requires the responsible supervisor to be qualified to a recognised national or international industrial NDT standard, and gives ISO 9712 Level II as an example. Section 5.2.3 separately requires two years of experience as an operator, technician or inspector within the approved activity. Certification and documented ship-side experience are both assessed."
