                "text": "For firms engaged in thickness measurements, Z17 section 6.2 sets renewal or endorsement at intervals not exceeding three years by verification that the original conditions are maintained. Other service categories run to five years by audit. Individual societies are entitled to require shorter intervals and intermediate audits, and a missed intermediate audit is grounds for cancellation."
