                "text": "Work back from the evidence the standard requires. Operators need a documented year of tutored on-the-job training, and the responsible supervisor needs two years as an operator in that activity. If those records do not already exist, no consultant can create them. Where the experience is real and only the documentation is missing, a focused programme rebuild plus a demonstration dry run is a matter of weeks."
